  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book is not written to guide, fix, or improve the reader."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 37
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is not psychology."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 38
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is not therapy."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 39
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is not self-help."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is an observation of how the human mind constructs meaning and then begins to live inside its own construction."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 41
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Nothing in this book should be treated as instruction or advice."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 42
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There are no techniques here."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 43
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No steps to follow."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 44
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No system to apply."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 45
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The ideas presented may feel uncomfortable at times…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 46
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "because they question assumptions that are usually never questioned."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 47
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The reader is not being asked to believe anything."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not being asked to reject anything either."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 49
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Only to notice what is already happening within experience."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 50
    }
